[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637620258","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102461#issuecomment-2637620258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102461","id":2637620258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dNuQi","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T17:49:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T17:49:34Z","body":"Will you estimate this will be solved by 4.4? Trying to see the urgency vs what is possible.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637620258/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2638232535","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102461#issuecomment-2638232535","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102461","id":2638232535,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dQDvX","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T23:06:01Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T23:06:01Z","body":"I'm hoping to get this completed and merged for 4.4, in theory it should already solve the issue, but it needs testing","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2638232535/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654025711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102461#issuecomment-2654025711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102461","id":2654025711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eMTfv","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T15:16:50Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T15:16:50Z","body":"Hi!\r\n\r\nNo. You should not need or use TextureFormatFlags.\r\n\r\n[VK_EXT_texture_compression_astc_hdr](https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/latest/man/html/VK_EXT_texture_compression_astc_hdr.html) added `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_nxn_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT` family of formats to deal with ASTC HDR.\r\n\r\nTechnically `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_UNORM_BLOCK` _could_ contain HDR data and be converted to the range [0; 1] but this is confusing; and having `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT` makes it much more explicit and the correct way to handle it (since LDR and HDR are and should be treated as different formats).\r\n\r\nThus when format is `ASTC_nxn_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT`, VkImageViewASTCDecodeModeEXT should be set to HDR (or not be called at all since the default is to use intermediate 16-bit precision anyway).\r\n\r\nSince the code already checks if format is between `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_UNORM_BLOCK` and `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_12x12_SRGB_BLOCK`, then there's nothing to do; as `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT` would fail this check:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (image_view_create_info.format >= VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_UNORM_BLOCK && image_view_create_info.format <= VK_FORMAT_ASTC_12x12_SRGB_BLOCK) \r\n{\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nDon't forget to request for VK_EXT_texture_compression_astc_hdr extension when creating the VkDevice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654025711/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654141222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102461#issuecomment-2654141222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102461","id":2654141222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eMvsm","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T15:56:17Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T15:56:17Z","body":"> Hi!\r\n> \r\n> No. You should not need or use TextureFormatFlags.\r\n> \r\n> [VK_EXT_texture_compression_astc_hdr](https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/latest/man/html/VK_EXT_texture_compression_astc_hdr.html) added `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_nxn_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT` family of formats to deal with ASTC HDR.\r\n> \r\n> Technically `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_UNORM_BLOCK` _could_ contain HDR data and be converted to the range [0; 1] but this is confusing; and having `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT` makes it much more explicit and the correct way to handle it (since LDR and HDR are and should be treated as different formats).\r\n> \r\n> Thus when format is `ASTC_nxn_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT`, VkImageViewASTCDecodeModeEXT should be set to HDR (or not be called at all since the default is to use intermediate 16-bit precision anyway).\r\n> \r\n> Since the code already checks if format is between `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_UNORM_BLOCK` and `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_12x12_SRGB_BLOCK`, then there's nothing to do; as `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_SFLOAT_BLOCK_EXT` would fail this check:\r\n> \r\n> ```c++\r\n> if (image_view_create_info.format >= VK_FORMAT_ASTC_4x4_UNORM_BLOCK && image_view_create_info.format <= VK_FORMAT_ASTC_12x12_SRGB_BLOCK) \r\n> {\r\n> }\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> Don't forget to request for VK_EXT_texture_compression_astc_hdr extension when creating the VkDevice.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nIt looks like currently the common RenderingDevice texture format enum only supports the `UNORM` and `SRGB` variants of ASTC, so when creating an HDR texture on the RD backend it gets treated as the `UNORM` variant. \r\n\r\nI'm assuming the proper solution to this would be to add the `SFLOAT` ASTC formats to the TextureFormat enum?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654141222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654239021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102461#issuecomment-2654239021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102461","id":2654239021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eNHkt","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T16:27:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T16:27:51Z","body":"> I'm assuming the proper solution to this would be to add the SFLOAT ASTC formats to the TextureFormat enum?\r\n\r\nYes. I just submitted PR #102777 to see if we can add it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654239021/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654788809","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102461#issuecomment-2654788809","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102461","id":2654788809,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ePNzJ","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T20:37:08Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T20:37:08Z","body":"Closing this as superseded by #102777","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654788809/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]